= Roseman University College of Medicine - Prompt 05

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Application Updates
- Limit: 250 to 1000 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2025-2026 from SDN school-specific thread
- Source: https://forums.studentdoctor.net/threads/2025-2026-roseman.1508062/
- Local notes file: prompt-05.local.md

#section_label("Prompt text")
Please include any updates to your application that you would like the Admissions Committee to consider when reviewing your file. This may include changes since the submission of your primary application, information not addressed in previous questions, or additional insights into your academic journey thus far.

#section_label("Shared backbone files")
- typst/shared/additional-info.typ

#section_label("additional-info backbone")
= Additional Information Backbone

Use this only if it adds real signal.

== Good Uses
- Important context not shown elsewhere
- Meaningful updates
- Clarifying unusual application features

== Avoid
- Repeating your personal statement
- Defensive explanations without insight
- Generic praise for the school

#section_label("School-specific tailoring")
Read `../research.md` and `prompt-05.local.md` before drafting a final version.

#section_label("Draft workspace")
Use this Typst mirror for cleaner review packets once Typst is installed.
